@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
allowmixing
title Template example — Dependency failure and affected capability
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

component "Identity / current authority unavailable" as I #FFE0CC
component "Protected operation admission" as P
component "Provider unavailable" as M #FFE0CC
component "External communication operation" as C
component "Artifact store unavailable" as S #FFE0CC
component "Exact representation retrieval" as R
component "Executor isolation unverified" as X #FFE0CC
component "YAML execution capability" as E
I --> P : refuse unsafe admission
M --> C : unavailable or retain prior unknown effect
S --> R : unavailable; no alternate private content
X --> E : gate execution; no web-process fallback

@enduml
